---
import VideoFrame from './VideoFrame.astro';
import Price from './Price.astro';
---
<section class="section steps-section" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="steps-title">
  <div class="wrap steps-grid">
    <div class="photo-col" data-motion="fade">
      <VideoFrame caption="Douglasdale, Bulawayo" label="Video: newly lined fish ponds filled with water, Douglasdale, Bulawayo, October 2025" />
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2 data-motion="lines" id="steps-title">How a job runs</h2>
        <p class="lede">From your first message to fish in the water.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="steps-track" data-motion="progress"><span class="rail" aria-hidden="true"><span class="bar" data-progress-bar></span></span><ol class="steps">
        <li data-step><h3>Ask on WhatsApp</h3><p>Tell our assistant the pond size you want and where your farm is. It replies within minutes, day or night, with a written quotation. Our team checks larger jobs first.</p></li>
        <li data-step><h3>Site visit</h3><p>We check your ground and your water before building. The visit is <Price k="site-visit" />, taken off the job if you go ahead.</p></li>
        <li data-step><h3>Build</h3><p>We dig the pond to 1.5 m, then lay and fit the liner. Half the price is paid before we start and half when the pond is finished.</p></li>
        <li data-step><h3>Stock</h3><p>We deliver your fingerlings and put up the bird net, if you've ordered them.</p></li>
        <li data-step><h3>Feed</h3><p>Order the right feed for each stage as your fish grow, and we deliver it.</p></li>
      </ol></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .steps-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 7fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 1rem + 4vw, 6rem); align-items: start; }
  .photo-col { position: sticky; top: calc(var(--header-h) + 1.5rem); }
  .photo-col { max-width: 26rem; }
  .steps { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; counter-reset: step; display: grid; }
  .steps-track { position: relative; }
  .rail { position: absolute; left: 1.05rem; top: 1.6rem; bottom: 1.6rem; width: 2px; background: var(--line); }
  .bar { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: var(--teal); transform-origin: top; }
  .steps li::before { transition: color 300ms, transform 300ms var(--ease-out); position: relative; z-index: 1; background: var(--mist); }
  .steps li.is-active::before { color: var(--gold); transform: scale(1.12); }
  .steps li h3 { transition: color 300ms; }
  .steps li.is-active h3 { color: var(--teal); }
  .steps li { counter-increment: step; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 3.5rem 1fr; gap: 0.25rem 1rem; padding-block: 1.4rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .steps li::before {
    content: counter(step); grid-row: span 2; font-weight: 800; font-stretch: 75%; font-size: var(--step-4); line-height: 1; color: var(--teal);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .steps h3 { font-size: var(--step-2); }
  .steps p { color: var(--muted); max-width: 34em; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .steps-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .photo-col { position: static; }
    .photo-col { max-width: 22rem; justify-self: center; width: 100%; }
  }
</style>
